  "findings": {
    "identity": "Wageningen Biology BBI, 2026–2027, 180 EC framework, broad cells-to-ecosystems profile with restricted choices and no selected formal major. Preserve the Math A example and first-listed BIC10306 laboratory RO2 for a cellular/plant/animal direction; GEN20306 applies to other directions.",
    "freshVersions": "Current programme complete response SHA256 93bec98a554f646c9751b9e5a132aeed3d2c3f1b22b15a9b16cea638ec03ea11, import 2026-11-13T22:02:29.179325. YBI86324 response 4e1409f3495bbc951459301004d2a4687ba77a83dd0d148c6fc818e2752fc2ac, import 2026-11-13T22:19:55.543088. Both differ from Nov11 complete payloads; read actual current structure/conditions rather than assuming harmless wrapper changes. All 47 current module payloads retrieved and content/requirements re-entered for the relevant common, choice, RO3 and zero-credit obligations.",
    "currentChart": "Public Biology page now links the current 2026-10 BBI chart; downloaded and read it. It corroborates 108 EC common including mathematics choice, 18 specialising, thesis24 and open30. It does not allocate the two preparing courses by thesis chair. Add as supplementary source; current programme/module records remain controlling.",
    "thesis": "Programme requires at least102 prescribed EC including all60 first-year and passing two RO3 courses preparing for the supervising chair. Current YBI86324 MK confirms102/allB1; AK allcommon plus AdvancedStatistics or EcologicalMethods and at leastone preparing specialising course, including RO2/RO3 after2024. AK does not expressly replace the programme two-RO3 requirement. Individual24EC laboratory/field/data-science/modelling research generatesnewdata withplan/article/presentations/defence/reflection. Registration at leastone month beforestart mandatory; discussproject at leastfour months ahead. Manual only indicated in Biologyprogramme Brightspace or on registration, neither accessed/attempted.",
    "ro3": "Minimum12EC and two chair-preparing RO3 courses are separate conditions: CBI20803,TOX20303,VIR20803 are3EC entries, so exactlytwo courses neednot total12. Current group/module entries do not give a chair-allocation matrix. MOB20306 assumes BIC10306 and BIC20306 or GEN11806; EZO22306 assumes relevant developmental/organismal foundations; WEC31806 supports field/statistical research and mentions FEM/PEN/REG theses, but one course alone doesnot establish the required combination. General common EZO23809 research preparation isnot an RO3 replacement.",
    "chairPages": "Re-entered current WEC,MOB,CLB,BHE education pages. MOB lists both GeneTechnology and KeyConceptsDevelopmentalBiology among many courses; CLB also lists developmental courses. A course list and available thesis supervision do not allocate a current BBI preparing pair. BHE lists current24EC YBI86324 alongside old12EC YBI85812; no current pair is stated. WEC points to Brightspace, BHE projects to account-requiring platform, MOB/CLB to coordinators. No login, registration, account, project enquiry or universitycontact attempted. Official searches found old2014–2015 manual and unrelated programmes/MSc guidance, not applicable current BBI requirements.",
    "reuse": "Retain sound 180 EC framework, 56 role-assessed interests, 34 actual UCR course contributions, three conditional schedules, bounded alignments and four prior offering/prerequisite repairs. Current main151-course workbook controls; no restored old offerings, no automatic repetition of unaffected external research or inherited approval."
